#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:2
msgid "Configuring two-factor authentication"
msgstr "配置双因素认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:4
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication (2FA) adds an extra layer of security to your Read"
" the Docs account. When you enable 2FA, you need to provide two pieces of "
"information to log in: your password and a verification code."
msgstr "双因素认证（2FA）为你的 Read the Docs 账户增加一层安全保障。启用 2FA 后，登录时需提供两项信息：密码和验证码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:8
msgid "Enabling two-factor authentication"
msgstr "启用双因素认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:10
msgid "To enable 2FA:"
msgstr "启用 2FA："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:12
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:30
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:39
msgid "Go to your account settings."
msgstr "前往你的账户设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:13
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:31
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:40
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Two-factor authentication`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Two-factor authentication` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:14
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:17
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Activate`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Activate` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:15
msgid "Scan the QR code with your authenticator app."
msgstr "用你的认证器应用扫描二维码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:16
msgid "Enter the verification code from your authenticator app."
msgstr "输入认证器应用生成的验证码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:18
msgid "Save your recovery codes in a safe place."
msgstr "将恢复码保存在安全的地方。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:22
msgid ""
"If you lose access to your authenticator app, you can use the recovery codes"
" to log in. Keep them in a safe place, as they are the only way to access "
"your account if you lose your device."
msgstr "若无法访问认证器应用，可用恢复码登录。请妥善保管，因为设备丢失时它们是访问账户的唯一方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:26
msgid "Disabling two-factor authentication"
msgstr "禁用双因素认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:28
msgid "To disable 2FA:"
msgstr "禁用 2FA："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:32
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Deactivate`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Deactivate` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:35
msgid "Managing recovery codes"
msgstr "管理恢复码"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:37
msgid "To manage your recovery codes:"
msgstr "管理你的恢复码："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:41
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Manage recovery codes`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Manage recovery codes` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/management/2fa.rst:43
msgid "From there you can download your recovery codes or generate new ones."
msgstr "在那里你可以下载恢复码或生成新的恢复码。"

